<title>POLAND: Polish shares end down in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end down in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIG and Budimex closed lower, Elektrim and Universal were flat and Stalexport closed higher in 1.3-million-zloty Warsaw-bourse continuous trade on Friday.</p>
<p>The remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>On Thursday turnover was at 1.6 million zlotys.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 0.7 percent in a 45.2-million- zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
